    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35281" root="قدر" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدَرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْرٌ</span>, throughout: (where its pl. is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْدَارٌ</span>; K, * TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُدْرَةٌ</span>: (in which sense
also its pl. is as above; K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبْرٌ</span>: and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقْدَارٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, <i>A time,</i> or <i>a place,
of promise; an appointed time,</i> or <i>place;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْعِدٌ</span>. (TA.) [See Kur, xx. 42.]

